.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Run a script:
.B kentscript run hello.ks
.TP
Build a binary:
.B kentscript build program.ks \-O3
.TP
Build for bare metal:
.B kentscript ring0 kernel.ks \-\-arch aarch64
.TP
Run inline code:
.B kentscript \-c 'print("hello from KentScript")'
.TP
Start the REPL:
.B kentscript
.TP
Start the security console:
.B kentscript security
.TP
Launch the built-in web IDE:
.B kentscript ide
.TP
Launch IDE on custom port:
.B kentscript ide \-\-port 3000
.TP
Debug with breakpoints:
.B kentscript debug program.ks \-\-break 10
.TP
Show system info:
.B kentscript info
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KENTSCRIPT_ROOT
Override the KentScript installation root directory.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.kentscript_history
REPL command history file.
.TP
.I stdlib/*.ks
Standard library modules (auto-discovered).
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Python 3.8+ and GCC/Clang for native compilation.
